WEBVTT

00:00:03.670 --> 00:00:05.390
Shugo, shugo!

00:00:05.390 --> 00:00:07.820
Start it off with a Doki! It's Shugo Chara time!

00:00:07.820 --> 00:00:12.470
We've got trouble! Amu-chan is being targeted by a scary upperclassman!

00:00:12.470 --> 00:00:14.750
H-He is just too scary!

00:00:14.750 --> 00:00:17.370
She is definitely in a crisis!

00:00:17.370 --> 00:00:20.810
But I get to do a whole lot today!

00:00:20.810 --> 00:00:22.020
Doki!

00:00:31.760 --> 00:00:33.410
Pyon Pyon

00:00:33.410 --> 00:00:34.570
Fumu Fumu

00:00:34.570 --> 00:00:35.480
Yeah! Yeah!

00:00:35.480 --> 00:00:37.080
Howa Howa

00:00:37.080 --> 00:00:38.280
Kira Kira

00:00:38.280 --> 00:00:39.210
Yeah! Yeah!

00:00:39.210 --> 00:00:41.970
What color is your egg?

00:00:41.970 --> 00:00:44.750
Yeah! Yeah! Yeah!

00:00:46.730 --> 00:00:49.790
Even if you say mean things,

00:00:50.260 --> 00:00:53.640
I know you really love me.

00:00:54.160 --> 00:00:57.310
Even if we fight a lot,

00:00:57.870 --> 00:01:00.980
it's just 'cause we're always together.

00:01:01.470 --> 00:01:04.040
Because you believe in me,

00:01:05.160 --> 00:01:07.800
I can do anything!

00:01:08.610 --> 00:01:14.100
And that's why I unlock my heart!

00:01:15.970 --> 00:01:19.810
The person you want to be; things you want to say.

00:01:19.810 --> 00:01:23.470
Important things; things that are true.

00:01:23.470 --> 00:01:27.180
Who you are; what you've yet to realize.

00:01:27.180 --> 00:01:30.830
Mysterious things; happy things.

00:01:30.830 --> 00:01:35.740
All of these things are inside your egg!

00:01:38.210 --> 00:01:39.880
Pyon Pyon

00:01:39.880 --> 00:01:41.030
Fumu Fumu

00:01:41.030 --> 00:01:41.970
Yeah! Yeah!

00:01:41.970 --> 00:01:43.520
Howa Howa

00:01:43.520 --> 00:01:44.730
Kira Kira

00:01:44.730 --> 00:01:45.680
Yeah! Yeah!

00:01:45.680 --> 00:01:48.420
What color is your egg?

00:01:48.420 --> 00:01:51.230
Yeah! Yeah! Yeah!

00:02:01.550 --> 00:02:03.190
Got it-nya.

00:02:03.190 --> 00:02:07.220
Ikuto, no one knows anything-nya.

00:02:07.220 --> 00:02:08.380
I see.

00:02:08.380 --> 00:02:13.180
Ikuto, I'll do my best-nya! I'll find your important violin-nya!

00:02:14.650 --> 00:02:17.350
It's not really that important.

00:02:21.100 --> 00:02:26.100
Fists of the Ultra Cute!

00:02:21.100 --> 00:02:26.100
Episode 57

00:02:31.750 --> 00:02:33.140
Ta-da!

00:02:33.140 --> 00:02:35.860
Look at this, I bought a Punyorin!

00:02:35.860 --> 00:02:37.930
Oh, that's so cool.

00:02:37.930 --> 00:02:38.970
Punyorin?

00:02:38.970 --> 00:02:39.920
There!

00:02:42.680 --> 00:02:44.820
Ultra cute!

00:02:44.820 --> 00:02:47.060
I suppose it's not really your style, huh?

00:02:47.060 --> 00:02:49.560
Doesn't really fit the whole "cool & spicy" thing, right?

00:02:49.830 --> 00:02:51.680
N-Not really.

00:02:51.680 --> 00:02:55.090
It <i>is</i> my style! I love it! It's so cute!

00:02:55.930 --> 00:02:57.610
Hey, look at them.

00:02:57.610 --> 00:02:59.140
That's not good.

00:03:01.060 --> 00:03:04.070
Something's not quite right.

00:03:04.070 --> 00:03:06.790
Cute things aren't allowed today!

00:03:06.790 --> 00:03:08.850
Oh yeah, now that you mention it...

00:03:09.850 --> 00:03:13.600
Tomorrow, Iwagaki-senpai from the middle school's team will be coming to practice here!

00:03:13.870 --> 00:03:17.930
He really hates anything cute, so hide all of it!

00:03:20.770 --> 00:03:23.030
Do you people have a death wish?!

00:03:24.110 --> 00:03:26.090
I think everyone's going a bit overboard.

00:03:26.090 --> 00:03:27.180
{Yo!}

00:03:29.680 --> 00:03:31.520
What the...

00:03:33.970 --> 00:03:36.170
Thank you very much!

00:03:36.170 --> 00:03:37.020
Yeah.

00:03:37.020 --> 00:03:39.290
Could that guy be...

00:03:39.290 --> 00:03:41.080
Iwagaki-senpai?

00:03:44.840 --> 00:03:47.450
So very soft...

00:03:47.450 --> 00:03:49.180
We told you not to bring that stuff today!

00:03:49.180 --> 00:03:50.140
Hide it, hide it!

00:03:50.140 --> 00:03:51.670
You wanna die?

00:03:55.400 --> 00:03:57.950
What the heck? That makes no sense.

00:04:00.870 --> 00:04:03.870
What am I going to do? Now I've gone and done it!

00:04:07.340 --> 00:04:09.360
And it's already after school.

00:04:09.360 --> 00:04:11.930
Seriously, when do they actually study?

00:04:11.930 --> 00:04:13.990
That was so amazing, Amu-chi.

00:04:13.990 --> 00:04:16.990
You picked a fight with Iwagaki-senpai!

00:04:16.990 --> 00:04:19.220
That's not exactly what I intended.

00:04:19.220 --> 00:04:21.240
Is he actually that scary?

00:04:20.850 --> 00:04:22.470
Special Report

00:04:20.850 --> 00:04:22.470
Iwagaki-senpai's Secrets Revealed!!

00:04:21.290 --> 00:04:23.150
Allow me to explain!

00:04:23.150 --> 00:04:27.720
Iwagaki Karate Dojo

00:04:23.160 --> 00:04:28.400
Iwagaki-senpai is the male successor of the karate dojo his family has run for generations.

00:04:28.400 --> 00:04:30.810
The strength forged into him ever since he was a child

00:04:30.810 --> 00:04:34.250
has made him more than strong enough to singlehandedly defeat a mountain bear!

00:04:37.420 --> 00:04:39.360
F-For real?

00:04:39.360 --> 00:04:42.290
I suppose this is farewell, Amu.

00:04:42.290 --> 00:04:45.700
To pick a fight with someone like that, you'll have to pay the price.

00:04:45.700 --> 00:04:46.990
I'm not going to die, okay?!

00:04:46.990 --> 00:04:50.470
Well, you might think that, Amu-chi. On the other hand...

00:04:50.470 --> 00:04:51.850
Amu-chan!

00:04:52.550 --> 00:04:53.470
Look!

00:04:53.470 --> 00:04:56.440
Someone must have dropped it.

00:04:57.260 --> 00:04:59.230
Hey, it's pretty cute.

00:04:59.230 --> 00:05:01.650
I guess we should take it to the teacher's office. {editor's note: not sure this deserves a mention, but it's typical for the lost and found to be located in the teacher's office in Japanese schools}

00:05:01.650 --> 00:05:03.060
Amu-chi!

00:05:07.970 --> 00:05:09.350
Why is he here?!

00:05:09.350 --> 00:05:10.910
His eyes are so intense.

00:05:10.910 --> 00:05:12.200
I can't even laugh.

00:05:12.200 --> 00:05:12.970
I'm scared-dechu!

00:05:25.460 --> 00:05:28.060
It doesn't look like he followed us.

00:05:28.060 --> 00:05:30.140
It's not like running away will-

00:05:31.120 --> 00:05:33.010
He's here!

00:05:38.570 --> 00:05:40.940
No!

00:05:40.940 --> 00:05:43.100
Why is he chasing us?!

00:05:43.100 --> 00:05:44.950
It sounds like they are having a tough time.

00:05:44.950 --> 00:05:46.560
Think they'll escape?

00:05:46.560 --> 00:05:49.580
Fight, Amu-chan! Go, go, Amu-chan!

00:05:49.580 --> 00:05:52.000
In any case, I will pray for their safe return-dechu!

00:05:49.580 --> 00:05:52.240
You can do it, Amu-chan! Go!

00:05:54.410 --> 00:05:56.590
Amu-chan and the others haven't come yet.

00:05:56.590 --> 00:05:58.430
Perhaps they went home?

00:05:58.430 --> 00:06:01.520
Yo! Is the new Jack workin' hard?

00:06:01.760 --> 00:06:03.560
In a manner of speaking.

00:06:03.560 --> 00:06:05.080
In a manner of speaking?

00:06:05.080 --> 00:06:07.460
You've been fulfilling your role perfectly.

00:06:07.460 --> 00:06:09.430
Oh, I wonder about that.

00:06:09.430 --> 00:06:13.800
I haven't told you yet, but the Jack has a secret mission.

00:06:13.800 --> 00:06:15.530
Oh, indeed he does!

00:06:15.530 --> 00:06:17.350
Secret mission?

00:06:17.350 --> 00:06:19.860
I'll let the prince here explain.

00:06:19.860 --> 00:06:22.970
Hey! Isn't that word dangerous?

00:06:25.030 --> 00:06:27.080
Heed my words, peasants!

00:06:27.080 --> 00:06:29.170
Avert not thine eyes!

00:06:29.170 --> 00:06:31.150
Former Jack, tea!

00:06:31.150 --> 00:06:31.960
Here.

00:06:31.960 --> 00:06:32.990
Shoulder rub!

00:06:32.990 --> 00:06:33.900
Right away.

00:06:33.900 --> 00:06:34.960
Chocolate!

00:06:34.960 --> 00:06:36.060
Jeez.

00:06:36.060 --> 00:06:37.790
You can at least feed yourself.

00:06:37.790 --> 00:06:41.480
I have to say, I'm quite taken back.

00:06:41.480 --> 00:06:44.160
In cards, the Jack represents a retainer.

00:06:44.160 --> 00:06:49.620
In other words, it is the duty of the Jack to be at the beck and call of the King.

00:06:49.620 --> 00:06:55.140
Dogs know no greater joy than to serve their masters, after all.

00:06:55.140 --> 00:06:59.640
Now, for your first duty, the new Jack shall massage my arms and legs!

00:07:00.990 --> 00:07:02.710
Fine, I get it.

00:07:02.710 --> 00:07:07.950
But I'm pretty strong, so it might hurt a little. Please try to bear with it.

00:07:13.950 --> 00:07:17.290
He is not yet used to serving his King, is he?

00:07:17.290 --> 00:07:18.680
Tadase!

00:07:19.900 --> 00:07:21.670
You've really changed, haven't you?

00:07:21.670 --> 00:07:24.560
I've always been tough on guys.

00:07:24.780 --> 00:07:27.790
Former Jack, something sweet.

00:07:27.790 --> 00:07:29.380
Here you go.

00:07:29.380 --> 00:07:32.390
I'm sick of chocolate! Bring me cookies!

00:07:32.390 --> 00:07:34.110
What do you think you're doing?

00:07:34.110 --> 00:07:35.440
You already ate half the chocolate.

00:07:35.440 --> 00:07:37.050
Finish the rest of it.

00:07:40.220 --> 00:07:44.940
Good, good. We can't let the King be a picky eater, now can we?

00:07:44.940 --> 00:07:46.850
Which one is the dog again?

00:07:47.080 --> 00:07:48.980
Well, that's...

00:07:48.980 --> 00:07:51.440
It's just Tadase's childish side.

00:07:51.440 --> 00:07:54.850
He always goes overboard in being a good kid, you know?

00:07:55.050 --> 00:08:00.140
That's why I think his King character is childish and selfish, unlike his usual self.

00:08:01.330 --> 00:08:03.910
And so, it's a man's place to take it all!

00:08:03.910 --> 00:08:07.270
That's what being the Jack is!

00:08:08.000 --> 00:08:09.670
I see.

00:08:09.670 --> 00:08:11.600
By the way...

00:08:11.810 --> 00:08:14.300
When you wore a skirt, how did you...

00:08:14.300 --> 00:08:16.100
You want to know?

00:08:16.360 --> 00:08:21.490
I forgot to mention it, but I always do things seriously.

00:08:21.490 --> 00:08:24.670
So I'd really hate it if you spoke about female clothing flippantly.

00:08:24.670 --> 00:08:27.400
If you want to know, it'd be best to just try it yourself.

00:08:27.400 --> 00:08:28.220
Uh, that's...

00:08:28.470 --> 00:08:31.220
Look! They're all back!

00:08:33.950 --> 00:08:35.770
I can't do it. I can't run anymore.

00:08:35.770 --> 00:08:37.220
Me, neither.

00:08:37.220 --> 00:08:39.790
Stay strong, you guys.

00:08:44.000 --> 00:08:45.570
What on earth do you want?

00:08:45.570 --> 00:08:47.290
Why are you chasing us?

00:08:47.290 --> 00:08:51.680
And why can't people have cute things just because you don't like them?

00:08:51.680 --> 00:08:54.220
What's so bad about cute things?

00:08:55.820 --> 00:08:56.640
You-

00:08:56.640 --> 00:08:58.260
Please calm down, Senpai!

00:08:58.260 --> 00:08:59.230
She's just a girl!

00:08:59.230 --> 00:09:01.460
Please spare her!

00:09:01.460 --> 00:09:03.330
Yaya, Rima, let's go.

00:09:03.330 --> 00:09:04.320
Okay.

00:09:11.850 --> 00:09:15.060
Man, I went and yelled at him. Think everything'll be okay?

00:09:15.060 --> 00:09:17.850
What if he ambushes me on the way home?!

00:09:17.850 --> 00:09:20.020
Why don't we ask Kukai?

00:09:20.020 --> 00:09:21.970
He said he'd be coming today.

00:09:25.890 --> 00:09:27.680
H-Hinamori-san!

00:09:28.780 --> 00:09:30.420
Hey, Amu-chan!

00:09:30.420 --> 00:09:32.530
Let go! Let go!

00:09:32.530 --> 00:09:34.890
I said no!

00:09:35.210 --> 00:09:37.760
Whoa, what a scoop!

00:09:38.360 --> 00:09:40.340
Stop it!

00:09:44.640 --> 00:09:47.340
Today was pretty eventful, wasn't it?

00:09:47.340 --> 00:09:48.170
Yeah.

00:09:48.170 --> 00:09:50.660
We were chased by Iwagaki-senpai.

00:09:50.660 --> 00:09:53.760
And we got to see Tadase-kun in a skirt.

00:09:53.760 --> 00:09:55.980
Well, that part wasn't so bad, I guess.

00:09:55.980 --> 00:09:57.140
Hey.

00:09:59.750 --> 00:10:01.420
We've gotta talk.

00:10:01.420 --> 00:10:03.160
Come with me for a sec.

00:10:24.040 --> 00:10:25.320
What am I going to do?

00:10:25.320 --> 00:10:28.380
Is he going to kick my butt like a mountain bear?

00:10:28.380 --> 00:10:31.690
I don't think he will.

00:10:31.690 --> 00:10:34.300
He doesn't look mad, exactly.

00:10:34.300 --> 00:10:37.890
Maybe he actually does want to talk about something?

00:10:38.100 --> 00:10:40.900
Um, what did you have to tell me?

00:10:44.020 --> 00:10:45.240
Can I go home now?

00:10:45.240 --> 00:10:46.420
No!

00:10:46.420 --> 00:10:48.640
Then tell me!

00:10:48.850 --> 00:10:50.660
B-But...

00:10:51.320 --> 00:10:52.840
Man, stop hesitating.

00:10:52.840 --> 00:10:54.620
Did you say hesitate?!

00:10:54.620 --> 00:10:58.300
You are hesitating! If you have something to say, spit it out!

00:11:00.520 --> 00:11:01.990
It's my love!

00:11:04.320 --> 00:11:06.200
A love confession!

00:11:06.200 --> 00:11:07.520
What's with this development?

00:11:07.520 --> 00:11:10.280
But I like another boy and...

00:11:10.280 --> 00:11:11.220
I love

00:11:11.220 --> 00:11:12.970
cute things!

00:11:12.970 --> 00:11:13.990
Huh?

00:11:14.650 --> 00:11:17.820
Oh, I see. You love cute things.

00:11:20.550 --> 00:11:25.220
Yes, cute things, like the recent Punyorin fad.

00:11:25.220 --> 00:11:30.210
Whenever I see something like that, I just want to touch them. It's so tempting, and...

00:11:30.210 --> 00:11:31.620
So that face was...

00:11:31.620 --> 00:11:34.130
Him trying to restrain himself.

00:11:34.130 --> 00:11:35.820
It's easy to misinterpret.

00:11:35.820 --> 00:11:37.800
I'm a failure as a man.

00:11:38.520 --> 00:11:40.990
To love cute things this much.

00:11:40.990 --> 00:11:43.300
I don't think so.

00:11:43.300 --> 00:11:48.310
No, cute things do not become the strong, steadfast man I wish to be!

00:11:48.310 --> 00:11:53.860
That's why, no matter how much I want to have them, to touch them, I must resist!

00:11:55.430 --> 00:11:58.640
The more he keeps yappin', the more lost he gets.

00:11:58.640 --> 00:12:00.470
He is indeed quite lost.

00:12:00.470 --> 00:12:02.210
And that energy...

00:12:02.210 --> 00:12:04.060
This will be interesting, don't you agree?

00:12:04.280 --> 00:12:08.740
Even so, I still can't let go of my little fawn. {I think translating "kojika-chan" to "little fawn" is appropriate here. If it's a name it is highly uninspired :)}

00:12:08.740 --> 00:12:10.010
Little fawn?

00:12:10.280 --> 00:12:12.980
You picked it up today, right?

00:12:12.980 --> 00:12:16.140
I'm the one who dropped it.

00:12:16.140 --> 00:12:19.100
So that's why you chased me?

00:12:19.100 --> 00:12:20.450
Yes.

00:12:20.450 --> 00:12:21.840
Oh, I see.

00:12:23.490 --> 00:12:24.310
Here.

00:12:27.490 --> 00:12:31.480
This is my little fawn, which I've kept with me ever since I was little.

00:12:32.120 --> 00:12:35.660
But one day, I'll have to part with this guy, too.

00:12:37.100 --> 00:12:38.550
That's what it means to be a man.

00:12:40.140 --> 00:12:42.530
Sounds like he's having a tough time.

00:12:42.530 --> 00:12:43.990
Pardon the interruption.

00:12:45.340 --> 00:12:46.200
Ikuto!

00:12:46.200 --> 00:12:47.820
Are you eavesdropping?

00:12:47.820 --> 00:12:49.510
How rude of you-nya!

00:12:49.510 --> 00:12:53.260
We were already here when you sat down-nya!

00:12:53.260 --> 00:12:53.980
Oh yeah?

00:12:55.170 --> 00:12:59.140
And thanks to that, we heard something we didn't want to hear.

00:12:59.140 --> 00:13:01.720
Well, that fawn was kind of amusing.

00:13:01.720 --> 00:13:04.980
Hey, don't say that!

00:13:04.980 --> 00:13:09.470
As if someone like you, who doesn't treasure anything, could understand!

00:13:09.470 --> 00:13:12.870
What'd you say? You don't know anything-nya!

00:13:12.870 --> 00:13:16.740
Ikuto is having a hard time right now because he lost something important-nya!

00:13:16.740 --> 00:13:18.950
He searches all around every day, without even sleeping, and-

00:13:18.950 --> 00:13:19.690
Yoru!

00:13:20.590 --> 00:13:22.700
Ikuto, wait-nya!

00:13:24.210 --> 00:13:26.200
Something important?

00:13:30.260 --> 00:13:32.180
How is that operation progressing?

00:13:32.180 --> 00:13:34.370
We've finished the simulations.

00:13:34.370 --> 00:13:38.110
All that's left is to inject the X Egg energy, and then...

00:13:40.470 --> 00:13:43.340
This violin will work quite excellently for me,

00:13:44.250 --> 00:13:45.170
Ikuto.

00:13:55.960 --> 00:13:58.480
Today's target is...

00:14:13.560 --> 00:14:17.400
Man

00:14:16.350 --> 00:14:17.370
I yield!

00:14:18.670 --> 00:14:19.840
Just as I thought!

00:14:25.170 --> 00:14:25.930
Halt!

00:14:27.610 --> 00:14:28.450
Yes?

00:14:29.870 --> 00:14:31.390
What is it?

00:14:32.460 --> 00:14:34.940
He said that he can see your hesitation.

00:14:36.190 --> 00:14:39.110
It is a waste for you to stray from the path of manhood.

00:14:39.110 --> 00:14:41.390
We must go to train the other pupils.

00:14:41.600 --> 00:14:43.380
You should remain here alone.

00:14:45.730 --> 00:14:49.120
For me to become a man like my father and grandfather...

00:14:51.240 --> 00:14:53.280
I must throw away this doubt!

00:15:02.450 --> 00:15:03.650
You are...

00:15:04.380 --> 00:15:05.780
You're lost, aren't you?

00:15:07.980 --> 00:15:10.140
This is magic jewelry.

00:15:10.140 --> 00:15:13.540
You shouldn't hold in your feelings.

00:15:20.180 --> 00:15:24.530
Just do what y'all wanna do!

00:15:24.530 --> 00:15:27.440
? Character Change.

00:15:28.490 --> 00:15:29.520
This feeling!

00:15:29.520 --> 00:15:30.680
There's no mistaking it!

00:15:30.880 --> 00:15:32.610
It's a ? Egg!

00:15:32.610 --> 00:15:33.120
Let's go!

00:15:39.890 --> 00:15:41.110
This is...

00:15:41.110 --> 00:15:42.100
Yeah.

00:15:42.100 --> 00:15:43.480
Over there!

00:15:43.480 --> 00:15:45.740
Everyone has gathered together.

00:15:45.740 --> 00:15:47.020
Amu-chi!

00:15:47.020 --> 00:15:48.470
So everyone felt it?

00:15:48.470 --> 00:15:49.780
Yes.

00:15:49.150 --> 00:15:52.030
Iwagaki Karate Dojo

00:15:49.780 --> 00:15:52.830
We can feel the presence of a ? Egg in this house.

00:15:52.830 --> 00:15:54.510
But this is...

00:15:54.510 --> 00:15:55.300
Yes.

00:15:55.300 --> 00:15:57.580
This is Iwagaki-senpai's house.

00:15:57.580 --> 00:15:59.880
